//   icons: every fill painted by the section's SVG assets vs the computed
//     stripe background, min 3.0 (WCAG 1.4.11 non-text graphics)
//   texts: every listed selector's computed color vs background, min 4.5
//     (WCAG 1.4.3 normal text; alpha is blended over the bg first)
